# Frequently Asked Questions

If your question is not answered here, create an [issue on GitHub](https://github.com/chemicaljs/chemical/issues/new).

<details>
  <summary>Do I have to use Svelte?</summary>
  <span>Yes. Previously Chemical supported any framework, but in V3 it was rewritten specifically for Svelte 5.</span>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Does Chemical support Ultraviolet or Rammerhead?</summary>
  <span>No. Chemical uses Scramjet exclusively to keep the API and maintenance simple.</span>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Epoxy vs Libcurl</summary>
  <span>Libcurl supports Firefox, while Epoxy is generally faster on Chromium-based browsers.</span>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Why are there no bare clients?</summary>
  <span>Chemical uses Wisp transports (Epoxy and Libcurl) instead of Bare servers, so bare clients are not used.</span>
</details>
